			"text": "### ⏰ Weekly Schedule Trigger\n- **Frequency:** Every Sunday at 4:00 PM\n- **Cron Expression:** `0 16 * * 0`\n- **Target Repo:** `rfrondorf12/ai-101B`\n- **Local Path:** `Applied AI/ai-101B`",
