			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🔍 Step 1: Inspect Changes\n- Navigate to `/Users/reesefrondorf/Downloads/Applied AI/ai-101B`\n- Run `git status --short` to check for modified, newly added, or deleted files\n- Ensure on branch `main`",
			"x": -150,
