		},
		{
			"id": "node-step2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 📦 Step 2: Stage & Commit\n- Stage all modified and new files: `git add .`\n- Check diff and staged status\n- Create timestamped commit: `git commit -m \"Weekly sync: YYYY-MM-DD\"`",
			"x": -150,
			"y": 130,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "3"
		},
